still a much worse experience than being in a real lecture hall.\n\nFrizzle lecture viewer is an experiment in a better way to watch online lectures. It's in a VR classroom, so there's no distractions. Also the lectures are scheduled live, so you have to show up at the correct time.\n\nWe're starting off with Havard's Introduction to Computer Science course - CS50. CS50 is one of the most popular computer science courses, over a thousand students have gone through the course on campus and online.", "short_description": "Watch scheduled university lectures in VR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Frizzle", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.frizzleapp.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Frizzle", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.frizzleapp.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1111891896252733"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031617_295535488772830_6422098937568414943_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1YC46BFo6KQQ7kNvwFuhoCr&_nc_oc=AdoNPKvVDDDh9wosSg5EGMvNNxCVcMFG6_Gh5RD5HXE5SFkQAkDg5gYTK5ITbEcGFY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGueStLmmRZJrx5Hv0SGfa9N0gRb6zGbgAPLEfr8pAHQw&oe=6A8D810F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_of